1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,699
Beyond physical safety, emotional and spiritual well-being is just as meaningful for older adults.

2
00:00:06,699 --> 00:00:16,535
After completing their daily check-in, seniors see a daily Bible verse appear right below the button, such as 'The Lord is my shepherd; I shall not want.

3
00:00:16,535 --> 00:00:20,071
' Tapping the card opens a full, built-in Bible reader.

4
00:00:20,071 --> 00:00:28,685
The complete text is stored directly on the device, so parents can browse chapters offline anytime without waiting for slow downloads.

5
00:00:28,685 --> 00:00:34,664
The font sizes and line spacing are enlarged specifically to protect older eyes from fatigue.
